  "review_findings": {
    "Save_Pose": "Existing validate requires owned EditB HoldPose before the additional native use_tweak_mode gate. Without live Tweak, Resume Editing error precedes local value reads/curve writes. Existing direct local scope.channels, nonbool finite values, exact owned draft/slot, constant endpoint writes and rollback remain unchanged; no C/world matrix bake is added.",
    "explicit_Sync_B": "Only an already active validated exact item and EditB session can reach the new capture. collectionFalse and HoldPose are both required; capture completes before existing commit. Capture failure prevents commit/export preflight. Closed sessions, collections, Loop, Raise and generic commit/exit do not receive auto-capture.",
    "UI": "SavePose poll requires active EditB HoldPose and native Tweak; SyncB active poll requires the exact EditB item/native Rig. EditA or foreign selecteditem/Rig disables dedicated Sync; closed existing availability remains. Operator identity and SavePose Undo options retained; Sync remains REGISTER only.",
    "boundaries": "No selection/visibility/timing tolerance/workspace/collector/exporter/scene/Source/readonlyA changes. Native control capture and Undo will need a genuine current-runtime owned UI test; owner pure tests do not prove that native boundary."
  },
